    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc1 Welcome to Fastline Rivals \u2013 The Ultimate Racing Experience!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buckle up and ignite your engines! <i>Fastline Rivals</i> is an adrenaline-fueled racing game that puts you behind the wheel in a wide range of thrilling race types \u2014 from professional circuit battles to wild street races, intense drift duels, challenging rally stages, and breakneck-speed highway sprints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a fan of precise cornering, white-knuckle overtakes, or raw drifting chaos, <i>Fastline Rivals</i> delivers a high-octane experience with something for every kind of racer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Diverse Racing Disciplines</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Circuit Racing:</strong> Race on professional tracks designed for speed, control, and technical mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drift Events:</strong> Slide your way to victory in specialized drift challenges where precision and style earn the win.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rally Stages:</strong> Tackle dirt roads, sharp turns, and off-road obstacles in point-to-point time-based rally events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Street Racing:</strong> Blaze through neon-lit urban streets, dodging traffic and rivals in illegal high-stakes sprints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highway Races:</strong> Max out your speed and reflexes in no-limits, high-speed chases across crowded freeways.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>A World of Speed</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through diverse environments, from tight city corners to scenic mountain passes, coastal roads, and industrial zones. Each environment brings unique challenges, hazards, and shortcuts to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Car Customization &amp; Tuning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream machine. Unlock, upgrade, and customize a wide variety of cars \u2014 from drift monsters to rally beasts and track-tuned exotics. Tune handling, torque, suspension, and more to suit your style and dominate every event.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Progression &amp; Unlocks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win races, earn cash, and climb the ranks. Unlock new vehicles, tracks, events, and cosmetic upgrades as you prove yourself across multiple racing disciplines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple race types: Circuit, Drift, Rally, Street, Highway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied environments and tracks with day/night and weather conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car upgrades and tuning system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed damage and physics model</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic AI opponents with unique behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-style handling with competitive depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and online leaderboards (future update)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements and controller support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fastline Rivals</strong> is more than a racing game \u2014 it\u2019s a celebration of speed, style, and competition. Whether you\u2019re drifting through hairpins or pushing 300 km/h down the freeway, every second counts. Are you fast enough to become the ultimate rival?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc1 Welcome to Fastline Rivals \u2013 The Ultimate Racing Experience!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buckle up and ignite your engines! <i>Fastline Rivals</i> is an adrenaline-fueled racing game that puts you behind the wheel in a wide range of thrilling race types \u2014 from professional circuit battles to wild street races, intense drift duels, challenging rally stages, and breakneck-speed highway sprints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a fan of precise cornering, white-knuckle overtakes, or raw drifting chaos, <i>Fastline Rivals</i> delivers a high-octane experience with something for every kind of racer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Diverse Racing Disciplines</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Circuit Racing:</strong> Race on professional tracks designed for speed, control, and technical mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drift Events:</strong> Slide your way to victory in specialized drift challenges where precision and style earn the win.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rally Stages:</strong> Tackle dirt roads, sharp turns, and off-road obstacles in point-to-point time-based rally events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Street Racing:</strong> Blaze through neon-lit urban streets, dodging traffic and rivals in illegal high-stakes sprints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highway Races:</strong> Max out your speed and reflexes in no-limits, high-speed chases across crowded freeways.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>A World of Speed</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through diverse environments, from tight city corners to scenic mountain passes, coastal roads, and industrial zones. Each environment brings unique challenges, hazards, and shortcuts to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Car Customization &amp; Tuning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream machine. Unlock, upgrade, and customize a wide variety of cars \u2014 from drift monsters to rally beasts and track-tuned exotics. Tune handling, torque, suspension, and more to suit your style and dominate every event.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Progression &amp; Unlocks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win races, earn cash, and climb the ranks. Unlock new vehicles, tracks, events, and cosmetic upgrades as you prove yourself across multiple racing disciplines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple race types: Circuit, Drift, Rally, Street, Highway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied environments and tracks with day/night and weather conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car upgrades and tuning system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed damage and physics model</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic AI opponents with unique behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-style handling with competitive depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and online leaderboards (future update)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements and controller support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fastline Rivals</strong> is more than a racing game \u2014 it\u2019s a celebration of speed, style, and competition. Whether you\u2019re drifting through hairpins or pushing 300 km/h down the freeway, every second counts. Are you fast enough to become the ultimate rival?</p>",
    "short_description": "Fastline Rivals is a high-speed racing game featuring circuit, drift, rally, street, and highway races. Customize cars, master tracks, and become the ultimate racing rival!",
